# Agent skills

Skills stay at `.agents/skills/**/SKILL.md`. This site includes the file so
the text cannot drift from the repository.

Canonical URLs:

- Blob: [SKILL.md](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/.agents/skills/manage-okmate-knowledge/SKILL.md)
- Raw: [SKILL.md](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/raw/main/.agents/skills/manage-okmate-knowledge/SKILL.md)

Cursor may also inject repository rules. The skill is the retrieve, author,
and validate procedure for `knowledge/`.

:include[path: "SKILL.md", language: "markdown"]
